<h1><a name="K-section">K</a></h1>


<p><b><a name="koch_curve">Koch Curve</a></b> &nbsp; &nbsp;
A <a href="glossary-F.html#fractal">fractal</a> curve that looks like the edge of a snowflake.  It has
no <a href="glossary-D.html#derivative">derivative</a> at any point.  



